蛇藤”的魔藤，顾名思义，将路过的魔兽和人缠死，变成肥料，总之，蓝祤森林里，危险丛丛。而这些危险，战轻狂是不太在意的，因为她此时正在生命空间里，和宝贝儿子刚联络完感情，不断修习她的灵力，现在的她已经是三星大灵师了。不断吐纳的她正想收气，打算出去捕猎，准备晚餐，突然，随心宝典打来了第三页，上边写着——御兽诀。御兽诀是以修习精神力为主，与魔兽的精神力相碰，镇压，直到一方示弱，则契约成功，否则，会被反噬，轻则精神力崩溃，成为痴傻废人，重则丧命。根据契约不同等级，不同数量的魔兽，御兽师的等级也有所不同。御兽诀初级至高级契约，对于低级魔兽，直接暴力镇压，为之驱使，不必浪费精神力；御兽诀王级契约，对于王级魔兽，分出精神力将魔兽的灵识捆绑束缚，使之驯服；御兽诀圣级契约，对于圣级魔兽，由于魔兽本身的傲气，需要将之打败，再通过精神力契约；御兽诀神级契约，神级魔兽具有高级灵识，双方同意，便可契约，若不同意，则将精神力覆盖吞噬魔兽的精神力，从而契约；看到这儿，战轻狂总结了一句话：驯服，协商神马的都是浮云，拳头硬才是真理啊！魔兽等级，魔兽与修灵者一样，同样分成不同类型，包括金木水火土……低级魔兽不具有灵识，高级魔兽也被成为星级魔兽，越往上，实力越强，修习的难度越高。一旦魔兽失去晶核，将无法再修习。高级魔兽，分为九星，战斗时，脚下具有魔法阵，星级悬浮其上，类型不同，颜色不同。例如：火系魔兽，就是红色魔法阵；王级魔兽，战斗时，月亮悬浮在魔法阵上；圣级魔兽，战斗时，太阳悬浮在魔法阵上；超圣级魔兽，魔法阵缩小，悬浮在头上神级魔兽，能吐人语，不能化形，契约成功，能提高实力，灵力晋级；超神级魔兽，能化为人形，拥有本命幻技；战轻狂觉得这是好东西啊，不要钱的打手啊！低级魔兽她还不放在眼里，可是那些超圣兽，神兽什么的，她还是很垂涎的。于是乎，她做了个重大决定，今天晚饭不吃了，就练精神力，好早日契约。凝神聚气，将所有杂念抛除脑中，她只觉得脑中一片空白，每一次呼吸，每一次心跳都达到同步，渐渐的，脑中星光点点，断断续续的，战轻狂加大力度，将那些星光都导在一起，逐渐汇聚，随着星光汇聚的越多，她的额头青筋暴涨，看样子很是痛苦，等到她将所有的星光凝聚成拇指盖儿大小的珠子时，早已经大汗淋漓，头皮发麻，喘息不止了。看样子，御兽师也不是那么好当的。抱着积少总能成多的想法，她认为来日方长，不急，总能成功的。现在还是去试试效果吧！从空间里出来，却发现已经是第二天早上了，吃了几口干粮，擦擦嘴，战轻狂很快的找好了目标，一只出来觅食的火云狂狮。走到那只狮子面前，见它警觉的看着自己，做出防备的姿势，战轻狂将身体里不多的精神力慢慢导入右手上，形成一个尖锐的三角形，说时迟那时快，在火云狂狮扑上来的同时，精神力化成的三角形一下子打入它的头中，只听噗通一声，庞大的火红身躯摔在地上，溅起一地的尘土。战轻狂走到它面前，看着那巨大的狮身不断发抖，摸了摸它的大脑袋，听到它呜呜的声音，有些好笑，大家伙这是在撒娇吗？刚想到这，就见它露出肚子，不停地打滚，圆溜溜的大眼睛讨好的看着她。战轻狂知道，这是它表示臣服的意思，不然不会露出肚子让她摸，和火云狂狮玩了一会儿，她站起身，拍拍它的大脑袋，示意它可以走了。火云狂狮迷茫的看着她，不明白她的意思，蹭蹭她的腿，低吼着。战轻狂只是想试试用精神力能不能契约魔兽，看来她成功了，不过，低级的魔兽她还没放在眼里，又拍了拍它，指了指森林深处，迷茫的大狮子这才一步三回头的走了。取的满意成果的她捕捉了一只珍珠鸡，撒了调料，拿出一个馍，做了个肉夹馍吃的欢快。边吃边想，契约动物，看样子是成功了，不知道，契约植物的效果会如何？吃饱喝足，又消化了一会儿，战轻狂向之前路过的蛇藤那里走去。看着蜿蜒盘曲的蛇藤，战轻狂同样凝聚出精神力，打在蛇藤上，蛇藤被攻击的疼了，丝毫没有臣服的表现，经过一阵扭曲后，成年汉子大腿粗般的树藤飞速的攻击她，一个后空翻躲过去迎面的一击，战轻狂打起十二分的注意，看样子精神力没多大作用，这是怎么回事？植物难道不是魔兽的一种吗？挥手化作火刃，将缠在脚上的蛇藤烧断，看着那段蛇藤不断的扭曲，又四面八方的向她袭来，没多大耐心的她直接运用火球术将这蛇藤烧了个干净，只剩下灰烬，风吹过，蛇藤永存天地之间。将衣服拢好，疑惑的她闪身回到了生命空间里。拿着一个生命果咔嚓咔嚓的咬着，战轻狂开动脑筋想这是为什么，从物种起源说起，人是最高等动物，然后是人类的近亲，都具有较高的智慧，接下来就是动物，无论是狮子老虎等猫科动物，还是狼，獒等犬科动物，都是具有灵识的，再低等的像蛇一类的爬行动物，也是有面对危险的本能的，所以说它们都是有灵识，有精神力的动物。而植物呢，显然是不具有这种灵识的，起码低等植物是没有，你攻击它，它只会本能的反击，也就是说用精神力根本就不能沟通，白费力气。可是，也不对啊！植物也有对外界刺激性的反应啊，像含羞草之类的。大自然中的生物经过物竞择天，都是能够趋利避害的，所以，植物到底能不能契约还是个未知数，也许是她的方法不对呢。想不明白，那就不想了，等以后找个明白的人问问就行了。现在，她还是应该更好地掌握精神力。盘膝而坐，将大脑放空，感受精神力的存在，渐渐的星光闪烁，逐渐汇聚，慢慢地融入之前的圆珠里，珠子渐渐变大一圈，战轻狂却没有任它继续变大下去，而是不断的压缩，有一句话叫做浓缩的都是精华，还是有道理的。刚才还大了一圈的珠子又变成原来的大小，或许更小一点，可是却也更加凝实了。睁开眼睛，今天就练到这儿了。看着不远处的宝贝儿子，战轻狂站起来，喊着：“熠儿，熠儿。”她知道，儿子能听明白。不一会儿，小人儿就从水里浮了上来，顺着水流飘到她面前，睁着大眼睛看着她。“娘亲的小熠儿，今天有没有乖乖啊？饿不饿，娘亲给你吃果果。”摸摸儿子的小脸，战轻狂笑弯了眼，将生命果碾碎，果汁喂给他。看着那小嘴一动一动的将果汁咽下，她笑的更甜了。自从她的宝贝儿子进入生命空间以来，就不离开生命泉水了，她也不明白为什么儿子非得泡在里边，以前没听说谁家的孩子是在水里长大的，不过，想不明白就不想，只要她每天都能看着他健健康康的，她就很满足了，也不去计较那些异于常人的举动。而且，她的儿子也不需要喝奶，每天都是三顿的喝果汁，原本她还想果汁不管饱，可是也没看过儿子因为肚子饿而哭闹不止，那么她就这么喂吧！总的来说，她的儿子还是很好养的。而每天除了喝果汁的时间，她都是看不见儿子的，因为用不了一会儿，她的宝贝儿子就会沉入水里，待在泉眼旁边，这么长时间以来，她也见怪不怪了。这样也挺好的，外面太危险，要是儿子在她身边，总有她照顾不到的时候，要是真的发生什么危险，她怕她会疯掉，所以，把儿子放在空间里，等他长大的时候再带他出去也不错，反正只要戒指戴在她手上，空间就一直在她身上，儿子也是走到哪带到哪，走哪哪是家。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 10 The Beast Control Technique changed places and ordered new dishes. Although the taste was not that good, Zhan Qingkuang still made do with it and filled his stomach. I have already inquired about it just now. As long as I pass through the Lanzhen Forest, I will reach the second largest city in the Jiasheng Empire-Holy Light City, and Yunshu College is here. Looking at the towering trees in front of him, Zhan Qingkuang tugged the bag on his shoulders and stepped into the Lanzhen Forest. Along the way, tall trees blocked the sky and were overgrown with weeds, some of which were sharp and tough enough to scratch people's skin. The colorful flowers are vying for beauty, but the more beautiful things are, the more dangerous they are. Yesterday, she saw a flower exuding fragrance that attracted a small chirping beast and swallowed it in one gulp. There is also a plant that looks harmless, but suddenly its vines shoot up, stabbing a fat wild boar into a bloody hedgehog like a sharp sword, which can only be turned into nutrients. There is also a magic vine called \"Snake Vine\". As the name suggests, it tangles passing monsters and people to death and turns it into fertilizer. In short, there are dangerous bushes in Lanzhen Forest. Zhan Qingkuang doesn't care much about these dangers, because she is in the life space at this time, has just finished the relationship with her precious son, and continues to practice her spiritual power. Now she is a three-star spiritual master. She kept vomiting and was just trying to calm down and plan to go hunting and prepare dinner. Suddenly, the third page of the Sui Xin Book came and it read - Beast Control Technique. The art of controlling beasts focuses on cultivating mental power. It collides with the mental power of monsters and suppresses them until one party shows weakness, then the contract is successful. Otherwise, it will be backlashed, and the mental power will collapse, becoming a stupid useless person, or even death. Depending on the different levels of the contract and the different numbers of monsters, the levels of the beast masters are also different. The basic to advanced contracts of the Beast Control Technique, for low-level monsters, directly violently suppress and drive them without wasting mental energy; the King Level Contract of the Beast Control Technique, for king-level monsters, allocate mental power to bind the spiritual consciousness of the monster and tame it; the Holy Level Contract of the Beast Control Technique, for the holy level monsters, due to the arrogance of the monster itself, it needs to be Defeat, and then go through a mental power contract; a god-level contract with the Beast Control Technique. God-level monsters have advanced spiritual consciousness. If both parties agree, they can make a contract. If they don't agree, their mental power will be used to cover and devour the monster's mental power to make a contract. Seeing this, Zhan Qingkuang summed it up: Taming and negotiating with divine horses are all clouds, and hard fists are the truth! Warcraft levels, Warcraft and spiritual cultivators are also divided into different types, including metal, wood, water, fire, and earth... Low-level Warcraft do not have spiritual consciousness, and high-level Warcraft are also called star-level Warcraft. The higher the level, the stronger the strength, and the higher the difficulty of training. Once a monster loses its crystal core, it will no longer be able to practice. Advanced monsters are divided into nine stars. When fighting, there is a magic circle under their feet, and the stars are suspended above it. They are of different types and colors. For example: Fire-type monsters are the red magic array; King-level monsters, the moon is suspended in the magic array during battle; Holy-level monsters, the sun is suspended in the magic array during battle; Super-holy monsters, the magic circle is shrunk and suspended above the head; God-level monsters can speak human language, but cannot transform. If the contract is successful, the strength and spiritual power can be improved; Super-god-level monsters can be transformed into human form and have their own illusion skills; Zhan Qingkuang thinks this is a good thing, a free thug! She doesn't take low-level monsters lightly, but she still covets those super holy beasts, mythical beasts and so on. So, she made a major decision. She would skip dinner today and practice her mental strength so that she could make the contract as soon as possible. Concentrating her energy and throwing away all the distracting thoughts, she felt that her mind was completely blank. Every breath and every heartbeat were synchronized. Gradually, stars were dotted in her mind. Intermittently, Zhan Qingkuang increased his intensity and directed those stars. Together, they gradually converged. As more and more starlight gathered, the veins on her forehead swelled, and she looked very painful. By the time she condensed all the starlight into a bead the size of a thumb, she was already sweating profusely, her scalp was numb, and she was panting. It seems that being a beast master is not that easy. Holding the idea that if you accumulate little, you will always make more. She believes that the future is long and if you don’t rush, you will always succeed. Let’s try the effect now! When he came out of the space, he found that it was already the next morning. After eating a few mouthfuls of dry food and wiping his mouth, Zhan Qingkuang quickly found his target, a fire cloud mad lion that came out to look for food. Walking in front of the lion, he saw it looking at him alertly and making a defensive posture. Zhan Qingkuang slowly channeled the little mental power in his body into his right hand to form a sharp triangle. Soon enough, at the same time as the Fire Cloud Wild Lion pounced on him, the triangle formed by his mental power suddenly hit its head. With a pop, the huge fiery red body fell to the ground, splashing dust all over the ground. Zhan Qingkuang walked up to it, watched the huge lion's body trembling, touched its big head, and heard its whining voice. It was a little funny. Is the big guy acting like a baby? As soon as she thought of this, she saw her belly exposed, rolling around, and looking at her fawningly with her big round eyes. Zhan Qingkuang knew that this was a sign of surrender, otherwise he wouldn't have exposed his belly for her to touch. After playing with the Fire Cloud Lion for a while, she stood up, patted its big head, and signaled that it could leave. The Fire Cloud Lion looked at her confusedly, not understanding what she meant, and rubbed her legs, growling. Zhan Qingkuang just wanted to try whether she could contract a monster with her mental power. It seemed that she succeeded. However, she didn't pay attention to the low-level monster yet. She patted it again and pointed to the depths of the forest. The confused big lion then walked away with three steps. With satisfactory results, she caught a guinea fowl, sprinkled some seasonings, took out a steamed bun, made a meat bun and ate it happily. While eating, I thought about it. It seems that the contract with the animals was successful. I wonder, what will be the effect of the contract with the plants? After eating and drinking, and digesting for a while, Zhan Qingkuang went to the snake vine that he passed by before.", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}